[{"title":"坦庵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"古调久沈响，断弦谁剪胶。\n有窍非混沌，有机惟桔槔。\n夫君独醒士，不肯餔世糟。\n一言取诸易，坦坦祛尘劳。\n严兹父师训，心兵敢芒豪。\n眷言笃由衷，永此岁寒操。\n行坦任失得，心静恣諠嚣。\n通都有康庄，行者歌陶陶。\n羊肠信诘屈，刬削亦见遭。\n物理可喻大，吾言君勿嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孔明出师表图","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"水安宫中日欲落，榻前面拜遗孤托。\n先皇饮恨臣所知，忍见翠华终剑阁。\n臣身与贼不俱生，誓提义旅清中京。\n汛除九庙光旧物，上谢先帝酬忠贞。\n六师戒日临河渭，晓发披忱表天陛。\n谆谆恢复次第陈，缕缕忠肝兼义气。\n事关宫府在相通，亲贤远佞先汉隆。\n后王不鉴高祖训，累我汉业遭尘蒙。\n汉家贼姓难两立，王业偏安大无策。\n鞠躬尽瘁臣所安，利钝成亏非可臆。\n炎精无光赤灰冷，五丈原头将星殒。\n牙前长史整旋军，巾帼老奴拜天幸。\n煌煌二表明丹青，文追伊傅光六经。\n留传人世劝忠荩，呵护时有神威灵。\n英雄无命古如此，大节堂堂映青史。\n君不见二十四疏请回銮，东京留守衔悲死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宋贤三绝卷","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"洋州太守生通神，胸中千亩吞渭滨。\n兴来拂拭鹅溪绢，落笔满眼生烟云。\n坡公墨竹半天下，独许洋州擅高价。\n涪翁一见心眼醒，题名聊复纪吾曾。\n天生三子人中杰，笔精墨迹成三绝。\n断缣只字落人间，见者惊犹捧明月。\n叶君叶君听我陈，物情好丑元因人。\n古来名笔岂三子，丈人屋乌类如此。\n请君收拾归紫囊，慎勿悬挂当中堂。\n恐惊风雨中夜生，帝遣仙官来取迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄华山房为杨孔直题","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"黄华之山起城市，山人卜筑偎山址。\n幽栖岂爱糜鹿群，万卷藏修遗孙子。\n风回涧道松泠泠，濯缨亭畔竹琮琤。\n午凉吹醒芸囱梦，尘心一洗秋空清。\n地雄景胜天开设，长价腾声属髦杰。\n万里桥西一草堂，千古人犹誇笔舌。\n山房主人元功孙，构堂仰止多殷勤。\n请看庙貌南山处，文公文敏伊何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还长沙","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"湘水浟浟几千里，慈帏五夜怜游子。\n楚天南望白云低，归心万点随流水。\n买舟明发潞河程，三月东风春草荣。\n停桡旅泊堪乘兴，酒债诗情著处生。\n行舟几遍看圆月，渐觉江南远江北。\n泼眼榴花岸欲然，计程应是家山侧。\n高堂晓占乌鹊喜，勿讶佳儿拜庭戺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"九原难唤孙阳起，天閒龙种沈洼水。\n是谁传此千里神，逸态英恣酷怜似。\n世情贵耳多贱目，叶公龙癖纷相属。\n眼前骏骨畴能知，幅缣尺素争誇毗。\n还君此画三叹息，物情好恶元无的。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"融轩","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"一室虽云小，中藏天下春。\n眼前皆物共，榻外亦吾邻。\n丽日风生煖，温泉脉自淳。\n笑渠失弓者，得计楚邦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代送奉化训导","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"官河坚欲冻，君此问征鞍。\n闽浙家相近，师生义自宽。\n讵须愁座冷，赢得是身安。\n桃李阴阴日，春风回讲坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊祀斋居和钟邦臣韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"翌翌郊坛肃，煌煌宝炬然。\n九重亲大祀，一德格皇天。\n礼乐周官盛，威仪法驾圆。\n小臣真庆忭，舞蹈际年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送南昌黄金任岑溪典史","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"一尉岑溪去，都城二月初。\n轻帆渡扬子，便道谒先庐。\n岭峤疮痍甚，公私困竭馀。\n知君挟奇术，赞画定勤渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳遣怀","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"佳节重三候，羁栖尚客边。\n春光俄又老，物色倍堪怜。\n曲水传周兴，兰亭想晋贤。\n留都今日会，分席怅无缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和邢三湖龙山别趣","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"不识云外趣，郊扉谁可俱。\n钟山屏突兀，玄武带萦纡。\n榻许高贤借，门回俗子趋。\n晚衙人吏散，万卷付铅朱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐怀归用邢三湖过章水韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"夜独摊书坐，乡心迸欲归。\n邻箫乱无思，窗月巧呈辉。\n咫尺闽山隔，苍茫雁宇稀。\n平生白华卷，情事笑多违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳明王先生命来教礼乡社竣事过余小诗赠别","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"督府匡时切，烦君此日行。\n弦歌教小邑，绵蕝肄诸生。\n俗化行看变，人才倘可成。\n新诗代琼赠，乡国为关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"席上和王公守备九日韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"即看今岁又重阳，对景令人忆故乡。\n潦倒且拚元亮醉，风流不学孟嘉狂。\n满城风雨催诗债，三径清香待菊黄。\n行乐及时聊尔尔，人间万事付茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代送陈德纯归家","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"去去君行不可扳，强将樽酒酌江干。\n情知离合人生有，自是交朋话别难。\n此际鄞江聊割席，他年京国共弹冠。\n雉坛旧有盟心约，别后相期保岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽胡尚礼和钟考功韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"三尺前旌粉字书，交朋谁不泪如珠。\n可嗟野外一抔土，无复人间千里驹。\n壮志不销成永恨，残编无地付遗孤。\n潇潇寒雨青灯夜，啼杀庭前绕树乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书斋谩兴","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"静掩重门昼不开，閒斋便是小蓬莱。\n有时佳客相经过，不许俗人轻到来。\n一卷羲经销日永，数联诗句咏悠哉。\n此情独有知心会，寄谢傍人莫浪猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子陵钓台","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"拟迹巢由与世违，徵书底事到茅茨。\n中兴已自英雄足，用世原非雅尚期。\n祗为故人聊暂出，那思好爵作生涯。\n炎刘四百年基祚，尽属滩头一钓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"春昼迟迟午思清，南窗睡起坐檐楹。\n好怀百种与千种，幽鸟三声复两声。\n不向江头观卧柳，懒于枝上听啼莺。\n门前一任春来去，花落花开总不惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中感秋","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"一夜金风报早秋，疏棂点点气萧飕。\n俄惊江上烟波冷，便觉郊原草木愁。\n万里归途犹作客，半生踪迹等虚舟。\n不堪肠断思乡处，满地芦花明月洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"维扬怀古","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"淮海维扬名尚在，繁华不见旧时州。\n烟迷吴苑巡游地，云锁隋家歌舞楼。\n千古废兴增感慨，百年身世且优游。\n君看数亩雷塘路，阅尽行人春复秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日书怀","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"趋朝日日五更初，退食归来个事无。\n清世不妨同吏隐，此身还似旧山癯。\n了知习静真成癖，时复长吟且自娱。\n午枕黑甜思一憩，生憎梁燕语惊呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈天祥宅赏莲有并头品字二种 其一","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"此花合是真仙谪，堕在君家盆盎中。\n并亸赪肩笑含露，相翻翠袖舞回风。\n双头绾就同心结，千瓣妆成一捻红。\n羞杀赵家亲姊妹，两心偏妒不相通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈天祥宅赏莲有并头品字二种 其二","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"红妆水面正抽簪，品字分明不用探。\n芍药连枝终欠一，牡丹并蒂不成三。\n薛家群从生同姓，杨氏诸夷出共骖。\n怜绝此花齐气味，寒香晚节各心甘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日书怀","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"节届书云默自吁，年华去我似奔驹。\n满前风景多新样，向后儿童成老夫。\n万里乡书经岁少，一官匏系许身愚。\n晴窗搦管聊裁句，兀坐檐楹对碧虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕奉和少宰柴墟先生韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"不用桃符写户厅，尧文历纪忽周星。\n中庭残雪初消白，明日群芳渐放青。\n爆竹满衢传煏煿，歌钟何处送东丁。\n太平景象留都好，唤起年来醉梦醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游灵谷寺","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"上方金碧出崭岩，满院岚烟滴桧杉。\n纵步恍疑腾汗漫，回头已自隔尘凡。\n灵泉有窍通仙脉，佛塔何年閟石函。\n风景阅来殊未遍，马头山色日将衔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起对雪和东坡韵 其一","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"怪甚寒空噪暮鸦，关河千里断行车。\n诸天有相皆成幻，古木无根也著花。\n锦帐酣怀归甲第，剡溪清兴在诗家。\n分明鸡鹜朝来迹，叠叠阶前作篆叉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起对雪和东坡韵 其二","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"落处无论巨与纤，平铺格样类妆严。\n庙廊调燮凭占岁，儿女商量谩到盐。\n谁向歌钟誇白战，我怜短褐有穷檐。\n江南一种天成趣，墙角疏梅正斗尖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答和陈虚宿韵","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"一饭从知荷主恩，山林何敢遂忘君。\n无端世事易翻覆，顷刻人情肖雨云。\n廊庙诸公期共济，烟霞老我许平分。\n傍花随柳寻常事，免得虚名惹世氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦雨","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"曙鼓微茫动海城，街头泥淖正纵横。\n昨宵旧雨送残腊，今日三朝悭一晴。\n渐老风光真觉别，殊方怀抱若为情。\n翻思二十年前事，曾托屠苏逞后生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯元夕","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"九十春容色色妍，上元乐事更无边。\n兼旬风雨朝来爽，入夜光华分外圆。\n运属昌期端有象，老逢佳景倍堪怜。\n半酣搦管裁新句，天与林泉自在年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送县大尹令子毛景润西归","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"鄞山鄞水亦佳游，何事君归不少留。\n无限别情销不尽，寒风马首正飕飕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼亡","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"箧有遗衣皆触恨，窗残晓镜亦成悲。\n伤心最是无穷处，记得挑灯伴读时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日对雪","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"梅花斗雪雨清妍，记得江南岁暮天。\n春到北枝犹未放，晨窗对雪亦欣然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄门许充衷使安南","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"天朝侍从入闽英，定有光声彻远城。\n海峤于今皆乐土，使车休问几多程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其一","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"逐队彤庭数载间，何曾两度侍宸班。\n略胜远嫁胡沙去，才得君王一动颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其二","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"花钱费尽画双蛾，望断金舆不见过。\n鷩听调莺宫树上，一年春事已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其三","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"暑簟瞢腾午漏长，分明梦里见君王。\n起来戏折宜男草，燕语双双傍画梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨 其四","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"锦树秋声入枕帏，天边牛女又佳期。\n罗衫虽薄难抛却，记得君恩赐著时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其一","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"姑射仙人冰雪容，淡香清影立薰风。\n似嫌尘世秾华涴，净洗从前水面红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其二","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"水面无花白似莲，玉盘擎处露娟娟。\n个般清韵孤标格，肯学漫山桃李妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其三","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"仙葩簇玉凌波出，白羽摇风翻翐翐。\n主人好事集宾僚，明朝有意还来不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其四","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"午夜嫦娥照清泚，玉簪堕在方塘里。\n侵晨幻作满池芳，一色璚瑶酷相似。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其五","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"一泓菡萏亭亭立，旧日红妆今变白。\n化工特地巧为容，莫道丹青描不得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其六","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"举世何人识爱莲，白莲风味更堪怜。\n千年高士陶彭泽，曾向庐山结社缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白莲七首 其七","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"分明仙种隔寻常，时逐薰风送粉香。\n芸馆槐亭清绝处，大胜艳冶与浓妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和天随生韵二首 其一","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"年年花信不相欺，五月红蕖浴锦池。\n忽讶碧簪纷在眼，奇观不数旧年时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和天随生韵二首 其二","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"前身玉女恐非欺，谪向人间堕镜池。\n粉瓣飘香欹欲堕，依稀按节羽衣时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"奚童背锦出郊坰，乘兴閒来访友生。\n秋意满天枫叶暗，隔林遥听读书声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送唐太守令子元殊还桂林","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"桂林西望隔长沙，独秀峰前是子家。\n老我旧游情眷眷，每思岩洞晓栖霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应聘","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"三年归卧故乡云，每被春风诱出门。\n行到会稽探禹穴，坐看东海浴朝暾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦戏笔","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"老子新年喜气冲，谩招毫管试春风。\n此生岁月还多在，酒圣诗豪未便穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"已卯六月二十七日早晚上梦中赋诗四句谩记之","author":"李坚（贞夫","text":"旅馆残灯客思深，笛声何处动乡心。\n明朝又买东吴棹，风景归来诧上林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠静轩","author":"罗荣","text":"自得江山性，从渠白发长。\n室虚凝月色，波定见天光。\n杖屦逢人少，茅茨与世忘。\n床头书卷在，简点到归藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘世宽之浙东","author":"罗荣","text":"烟树云盘绿，官程马足分。\n阳山偏向日，越水易生云。\n远海盐征竭，清时国计殷。\n驰情多别后，对月每思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯有孚使九江便道宁亲","author":"罗荣","text":"三载结尘缨，看云白发生。\n春风仙棹远，昼日锦衣明。\n飞鹤迎亲寿，慈乌致子情。\n承欢须秉烛，候吏立湓城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈世则判陈州马政","author":"罗荣","text":"秣马退朝时，东城出饯迟。\n分襟乡语细，看剑祖杯迟。\n外厩增云锦，穷才罢茧丝。\n委蛇堂食后，花鸟乱催诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋次临清和韵答周宪副","author":"罗荣","text":"久阔头将白，相逢眼倍青。\n蘋风清夕舫，桂月满秋汀。\n好句输先得，深杯不放停。\n江湖怜此会，乡旧正晨星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叶太守回任","author":"罗荣","text":"五马春城外，东风草色新。\n寇君还借郡，召父旧亲民。\n皂盖云霄过，青山廨宇邻。\n不须伤远别，江汉有通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28469,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水","author":"罗荣","text":"碧嶂秀重重，岧荛逼华嵩。\n雨淙孤壑应，云壁小蹊通。\n呼酒三村社，藏书一亩宫。\n山深人不见，花鸟领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28470,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲秋十六夜发榆之南","author":"罗荣","text":"日暮官途马足轻，萧萧凉籁逼人清。\n蒹葭水郭凫鹥梦，篱落田家蟋蟀声。\n小堡铜刁持夜警，远氓皮橐事宵征。\n月华光满浑如昨，万里江山仰大明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28471,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"督储至白羊口信宿游西山诸寺","author":"罗荣","text":"白羊城堡枕关腰，上谷春风冻未消。\n薄□五更侵土炕，残澌二月下山桥。\n老僧肃客焚香迓，稚子烹茶扫叶烧。\n大觉以南皆赐寺，宦游应喜避尘嚣。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28472,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过武夷","author":"罗荣","text":"再访神居结地幽，武夷真境拟蓬丘。\n閒开竹径风生籁，深闭松关月在洲。\n函蜕藏香封玉匣，插厓横木讶仙舟。\n紫阳倚棹歌声远，九曲名称遍十洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28473,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]